            <value>
               <exData contentType="text/html">
                  <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">INSTRUCTIONS:<span style="font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none"> Before further action can be taken on your financial aid application, the following information is required. Please verify information regarding the value your Parents' investments and real estate, excluding their principal residence. See definition of parent below. Attach copies of the documentation used to calculate the value and debt of items listed below.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span>Several documents may be used to verify real estate or investment value and debt (e.g., statements from a real estate office, mortgage statement, local newspaper ads, and/or comparable property listings).<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none">Incomplete documents will not be returned. They will be disposed of in a secure manner, per university policy. This will delay processing.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></span></p></body>
